entries.content:
Type={Shapeshifter}
Habitat={Towers and caves, anywhere cheata or other treasures can be found}
Diet={Men's essence, Meat and blood, can eat literally anything},
Traits={Human appearance but can shapeshift}
Description={Mimics are monsters that can shapeshift into treasure (and various objects) to trap adventurers. They live in dungeons and towers, moving to places with many treasures and humans. When a person gets close to the treasure, the mimic opens its maw and tries to eat them. However there are some mimics that are friendly, they are sometimes kept as pets by humans, who feed them animal meat. They can reproduce with humans and birth offspring.}
